[C7]Christian [Am]children all [Gm/D]must [C7]be
[C7]Mild, obedient, [Am]good [C7/Bb]as He.

Verse 4:
[C]And [C7/Bb]our [Dm/A]eyes [F]at last shall see [C7/Bb]Him,
[Dm/A]Through [F]His own redeeming [C7/G]love;
